2150 Q 992 1824 1184 1667 Q 1376 1510 1702 1510 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-7\" d=\"M 723 0 L 723 2854 L 186 2854 L 186 3302 L 723 3302 L 723 3968 Q 723 4307 902 4521 Q 1082 4736 1446 4736 L 1946 4736 L 1946 4288 L 1235 4288 L 1235 3302 L 1946 3302 L 1946 2854 L 1235 2854 L 1235 0 L 723 0 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-b\" d=\"M 544 0 L 544 4736 L 1056 4736 L 1056 2765 L 1082 2765 Q 1203 3046 1424 3212 Q 1645 3379 2016 3379 Q 2528 3379 2825 3049 Q 3123 2720 3123 2118 L 3123 0 L 2611 0 L 2611 2029 Q 2611 2470 2422 2694 Q 2234 2918 1862 2918 Q 1658 2918 1472 2851 Q 1286 2784 1171 2643 Q 1056 2502 1056 2291 L 1056 0 L 544 0 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-1c\" d=\"M 1779 1056 L 2579 3302 L 3085 3302 L 1606 -768 Q 1536 -966 1449 -1078 Q 1363 -1190 1222 -1235 Q 1082 -1280 838 -1280 L 576 -1280 L 576 -832 L 1094 -832 L 1344 -128 L 109 3302 L 621 3302 L 1414 1056 L 1568 518 L 1600 518 L 1779 1056 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-33\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-6\" transform=\"translate(57.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-f\" transform=\"translate(112.8125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-c\" transform=\"translate(140.015625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-16\" transform=\"translate(165.015625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-16\" transform=\"translate(213.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-6\" transform=\"translate(261.828125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e9\" transform=\"translate(316.734375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-30\" transform=\"translate(340.328125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-e\" transform=\"translate(398.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-c\" transform=\"translate(451.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-11\" transform=\"translate(476.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e9\" transform=\"translate(532.921875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-10\" transform=\"translate(556.515625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-1\" transform=\"translate(643.8125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-15\" transform=\"translate(697.21875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-8\" transform=\"translate(731.625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-c\" transform=\"translate(784.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-11\" transform=\"translate(809.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e9\" transform=\"translate(866.21875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-1\" transform=\"translate(889.8125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-7\" transform=\"translate(943.21875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-17\" transform=\"translate(975.625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-6\" transform=\"translate(1010.3125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-15\" transform=\"translate(1065.21875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e9\" transform=\"translate(1101.921875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-13\" transform=\"translate(1125.515625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-b\" transform=\"translate(1183.515625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-1\" transform=\"translate(1240.3125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-15\" transform=\"translate(1293.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-10\" transform=\"translate(1330.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-1\" transform=\"translate(1417.71875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-4\" transform=\"translate(1471.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-1c\" transform=\"translate(1521.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e9\" transform=\"translate(1571.328125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-16\" transform=\"translate(1594.921875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-b\" transform=\"translate(1643.625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-1\" transform=\"translate(1700.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-15\" transform=\"translate(1753.828125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-6\" transform=\"translate(1790.03125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3e9\" transform=\"translate(1844.9375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-70\" transform=\"translate(1868.53125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-ae\" transform=\"translate(1902.03125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-71\" transform=\"translate(1961.828125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p0988773416\"><rect x=\"40.7\" y=\"28\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"127.512\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Retail price and Velisse Skin's margin per unit ($)","note":null},"answer":"<p>Velisse Skin receives 65% of the retail price; the pharmacy keeps 35%.</p> <p>Bottle: $48 × 65% = $31.20 − $18 = <b>$13.20</b>. Refill: $40 × 65% = $26.00 − $11 = <b>$15.00</b>. A refill earns Velisse Skin more than a bottle.</p> <p>A switcher's annual margin: 3.4 × $15.00 = $51.00 vs 3 × $13.20 = $39.60 before: <b>+$11.40</b> each.</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> cannibalisation doesn't hurt here; switching customers are worth more.</p>"},{"q":"Calculate the total annual impact.","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>Switchers: 61.6k × $11.40 = $0.70M.</p> <p>New customers: 32k × (1 bottle × $13.20 + 2.4 refills × $15.00) = $1.57M.</p> <p>Minus $1.35M of costs: <b>+$0.93M a year</b>.</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> worthwhile, and most of the value comes from new customers, but the yearly costs eat most of the gross gain.</p>"},{"q":"How might pharmacies react, and what would you do?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>A pharmacy earns $16.80 on a bottle but $14.00 on a refill: they lose $2.80 each time a customer switches, so they may not stock or promote refills.</p> <p>Matching their $16.80 on every refill needs a 42% share. That cuts Velisse Skin's refill margin to $12.20 and the total gain to about +$0.13M a year: almost nothing.</p> <ul><li>Raise the pharmacy's share on refills only partly, or tie it to refill volume</li><li>Refill-station displays that also bring traffic into the pharmacy</li> <li>Sell refills online too, but avoid undercutting pharmacies on price</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Launch the refill. After the pharmacy's 35% share, Velisse Skin earns more on a refill ($15.00) than on a bottle ($13.20), so switching customers are worth more, and new customers add most of the value: about +$0.93M a year after launch costs. The real risk is pharmacies, which earn $2.80 less per refill. Raise their share on refills only partly (matching them fully would cut the gain to about $0.1M), or tie it to refill volume. Next step: test refill stations in 50 pharmacies for three months.","great":["Works out the margin after the channel's share, not on retail price","Shows cannibalisation is harmless here","Quantifies the new-customer gain","Spots the channel partner's incentive problem and prices the fix"],"id":44,"slug":"velisse-skin"}